<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Sept Y/Y inflation seen 22.2/22.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary Sept Y/Y inflation seen 22.2/22.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's September year-on-year inflation was seen declining to 22.2 to 22.3 percent, versus 22.9 percent in August, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040</p>
